---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "@components/container.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Tech Force OÜ and techforce.pro">
  <Container>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-16">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-800">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 mt-2">Last updated: January 2025</p>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800">1. Who we are</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            This website is operated by Tech Force OÜ, a company registered in Estonia. References to "TechForce", "we", "us", or "our" refer to Tech Force OÜ.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Contact: <!-- CONTACT_EMAIL -->
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800">2. What data we collect</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We collect information you provide directly to us, including:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
            <li>Name, company, and email address when you submit a contact form</li>
            <li>Project description and communication content</li>
            <li>Information provided during discovery calls</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We do not collect any data automatically beyond standard web server logs (IP address, browser type, page visited, timestamp), which are retained for security purposes and deleted after 30 days.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800">3. How we use your data</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We use the information you provide to:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
            <li>Respond to your enquiry or schedule a call</li>
            <li>Discuss and scope potential projects</li>
            <li>Communicate during an active engagement</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We do not use your data for marketing purposes without explicit consent. We do not sell or share your data with third parties except as required to deliver services (e.g., email providers, scheduling tools).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800">4. Legal basis (GDPR)</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            For visitors in the European Economic Area, our legal basis for processing contact form submissions is legitimate interest (responding to a business enquiry). We retain contact data for up to 2 years unless you request deletion.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800">5. Your rights</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            You have the right to access, correct, or delete any personal data we hold about you. To exercise these rights, contact us at <!-- CONTACT_EMAIL --> and we will respond within 30 days.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800">6. Cookies</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            This website does not use tracking cookies. We do not run analytics, advertising, or retargeting scripts.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800">7. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We may update this policy from time to time. The current version will always be available at this URL with the date updated above.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>
